    'All <span style="color: orangered; font-weight:700;">living things</span> are made up of one or more <span style="color: mediumblue; font-weight:700;">cells</span>.',
    '<span style="color: mediumblue; font-weight:700;">Cells</span> are the basic building blocks of all <span style="color: orangered; font-weight:700;">living things</span>.',
